/**
 * @file useCaseBipolarTModel.cnl
 *   Test case for linNet.
 *
 * Single stage linear audio amplifier using bipolar transistor. Both,
 * frequency response and DC operation point of the stage can be discussed
 * based on the linNet calculation results.
 * 
 * The circuit is an example from the linNet manual, see Chapter 8.3,
 * Transistor model, for the detailled discussion.
 * 
 * An added, manually made M script, BipolarTModel_opRangeByLsim.m, helps
 * understanding what the strictly linear behavior of linNet means - what
 * can be simulated, what fails to simulate.
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2014-2026 Peter Vranken (mailto:Peter_Vranken@Yahoo.de)
 *
